Significance: minor
Type: changed

The `read_post` and `edit_post` capability constants move from `Event` to a new `GatherPress\Core\Capability` class, since they apply to any post type, and the plugin's capability checks use them instead of bare strings. `Event::READ_CAPABILITY` and `Event::EDIT_CAPABILITY` are removed, so code using them should switch to `Capability::READ_POST` and `Capability::EDIT_POST`.
